{"unit_id":"Machine-126__dsh-alert-sound#card-zh","repo":"Machine-126/dsh-alert-sound","commit":"de7c50934fc83f4e93931305cbdf941b044d70ed","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-alert-sound 是面向 DSH Web 的会话通知插件，通过观察会话运行状态与待处理交互，在需要审批、需要回答、输出完成、发生错误或检测到停滞时发出不同提示。它可播放合成音、浏览器语音或自定义音频，也支持重复提醒、勿扰时段、浏览器系统通知、完成回复朗读和可选悬浮提示。设置页提供中英文界面及逐类音量、音色和开关。适合希望切换窗口后仍能及时处理 DSH 会话的人；无需 API 密钥或外部账号，使用浏览器本地音频能力。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:469-504","lib/client.js:601-690","lib/client.js:863-959"]}
{"unit_id":"Machine-126__dsh-alert-sound#card-en","repo":"Machine-126/dsh-alert-sound","commit":"de7c50934fc83f4e93931305cbdf941b044d70ed","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-alert-sound notifies DSH Web users about approvals, questions, completed turns, errors, and optional stalled sessions. It offers distinct tones, speech, custom audio, repeat alerts, do-not-disturb hours, browser notifications, optional reply read-aloud, and a bilingual settings panel.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:469-504","lib/client.js:601-690","lib/client.js:863-959"]}
