{"unit_id":"Machine-126__dsh-alert-sound#feature-alert-types","repo":"Machine-126/dsh-alert-sound","commit":"de7c50934fc83f4e93931305cbdf941b044d70ed","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-alert-sound 的功能「按会话事件提醒」：区分审批、问题、完成、错误和可选停滞状态。状态变化触发对应音色或语音，审批与问题可按间隔重复提醒。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:469-504","lib/client.js:633-690","lib/client.js:747-775"]}
{"unit_id":"Machine-126__dsh-alert-sound#feature-audio","repo":"Machine-126/dsh-alert-sound","commit":"de7c50934fc83f4e93931305cbdf941b044d70ed","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-alert-sound 的功能「多种声音和朗读」：可为提醒选择合成音、浏览器语音、自定义音频或静音。完成时可朗读最后一条助手回复，并在语音不可用时回退到提示音。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:41-44","lib/client.js:125-174","lib/client.js:547-590"]}
{"unit_id":"Machine-126__dsh-alert-sound#feature-settings","repo":"Machine-126/dsh-alert-sound","commit":"de7c50934fc83f4e93931305cbdf941b044d70ed","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-alert-sound 的功能「提醒设置」：在设置面板调整提醒范围、音量、重复间隔、勿扰时段、语言、停滞检测和逐类音色，并可预览或上传不超过 2 MB 的自定义声音。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:863-959","lib/client.js:110-124"]}
{"unit_id":"Machine-126__dsh-alert-sound#feature-browser-notifications","repo":"Machine-126/dsh-alert-sound","commit":"de7c50934fc83f4e93931305cbdf941b044d70ed","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-alert-sound 的功能「浏览器系统通知」：开启后请求浏览器通知权限，并在获准时显示提醒类型及简短详情，方便在后台或切换标签页时查看。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:176-194","lib/client.js:900-902"]}
{"unit_id":"Machine-126__dsh-alert-sound#feature-toast","repo":"Machine-126/dsh-alert-sound","commit":"de7c50934fc83f4e93931305cbdf941b044d70ed","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-alert-sound 的功能「悬浮提示」：启用后在 DSH 界面显示当前提醒类型的短暂提示条；若宿主没有共享 Toast 组件，则使用插件内置样式显示。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:402-435","lib/client.js:962-1006"]}
{"unit_id":"Machine-126__dsh-alert-sound#caveat-browser-audio","repo":"Machine-126/dsh-alert-sound","commit":"de7c50934fc83f4e93931305cbdf941b044d70ed","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-alert-sound 使用前须知：浏览器可能要求先通过点击或按键等用户操作解锁音频；语音播报需要浏览器提供 Speech Synthesis，缺失或未启动时会回退为提示音。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1008-1019","lib/client.js:125-174"]}
{"unit_id":"Machine-126__dsh-alert-sound#caveat-version","repo":"Machine-126/dsh-alert-sound","commit":"de7c50934fc83f4e93931305cbdf941b044d70ed","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-alert-sound 使用前须知：审批和提问提醒依赖 DSH 0.2.0-rc.2 起提供的 uiSession.sessionStatus；更早宿主缺少该服务时，这两类提醒不会工作。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:717-731","package.json:57-59"]}
{"unit_id":"Machine-126__dsh-alert-sound#caveat-stall","repo":"Machine-126/dsh-alert-sound","commit":"de7c50934fc83f4e93931305cbdf941b044d70ed","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-alert-sound 使用前须知：停滞提醒默认关闭，依赖会话 updatedAt 判断长时间无进展，代码将其标为实验性启发式检测。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:747-775","lib/client.js:30-33"]}
